  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The reaction of&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5a2a91ee-525e-4325-b5a0-ace53663dc13-image.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 80px;\" />&nbsp;with bromine and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi></math> gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>RNH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> as the end product. Which one of the following is the intermediate product formed in this reaction?</p>",
