  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given reaction follows Hoffman bromamide&nbsp;degradation mechanism for the preparation of primary amines. In this reaction alkyl or aryl isocynate&nbsp;is formed as an intermediate. The formation of intermediate is shown below.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/43686a15-6dde-4fa0-afb5-383494876bad-image.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 280px;\" /></p>",
